Blastula helps with emailing.

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:11.460
So we'll use some
Blastula functions

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:12.990
at the end of this document.

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:16.553
And glue is a really
wonderful package for--

00:23:16.553 --> 00:23:17.970
it's like an
