00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:21.810
So if you want to make a string,
let's say a custom subject,

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:23.520
quite a bit easier
to use glue and some

00:23:23.520 --> 00:23:26.510
variables that you
generated in this document.

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:28.500
So let me show you
the first chunk here.

